        "your crew sent you up here alone? brave",
        "stop running and face me",
        "done already? thought you'd be trouble",
        "was that the lag or is your reflex just that bad?",
        "your HP drops faster than your rep on the block",
        "even the track rat hits better",
        "sit down. the payback's coming",
        "you came for my spot with THAT hand?",
        "note that hit. it's landing again",
