        "bloqueado_cta": "Take the previous route",
        "facil_ultimo": "You REALLY think you're going to face the last hood's boss playing on EASY? He won't even stoop to look at you. On easy you get to the 6th and that's it — whoever wants the top plays for real. Bump it to Medium at least, kid.",
        "facil_ultimo_cta": "Raise the difficulty",
