        "enfrentar": "Face off",
        "precisa_informante": "🔍 Before you face the Feira's heavy, go back to the Pista and have a word with Duda. He knows things worth gold.",
        "brigar": "Fight",
        "agora_nao": "Not now",
        "continuar_territorio": "Stay on the block",
